     "kind": "text",
     "x": 60,
     "y": 292,
     "w": 500,
     "h": 84,
     "text": "The quarter closed with ARR of £48.6M, £1.1M ahead of plan, driven by enterprise renewals and the Meridian platform launch. Gross margin fell 1.8 points as compute costs grew faster than revenue. Management asks the board to approve a cost programme that restores margin by Q1 FY27.",
